{"uid":"d7b6aa5672df864d","name":"test_resolve_refuses_another_users_unshared_personal_prompt","fullName":"tests.test_workspace_release_prompt_adapter#test_resolve_refuses_another_users_unshared_personal_prompt","historyId":"891fb2b3e5b6a411f0008640f7eb74c8","time":{"start":1791913055062,"stop":1791913055079,"duration":17},"description":"The actual disclosure this fix closes: a personal prompt\n    (``project_id=None``, ``visibility=\"user\"``) has the *same* ``None``\n    project id as a public prompt, so a bare ``target.project_id !=\n    caller's project`` comparison could not tell them apart and would let\n    any operator on any project snapshot another user's unshared personal\n    prompt by name. Must be refused now, the same way\n    ``routes/prompts.py``'s lookup routes already refuse it (`P2-N`/`P2-O`).","descriptionHtml":"<p>The actual disclosure this fix closes: a personal prompt<br />\n(<code>project_id=None</code>, <code>visibility=&quot;user&quot;</code>) has the <em>same</em> <code>None</code><br />\nproject id as a public prompt, so a bare <code>target.project_id != caller's project</code> comparison could not tell them apart and would let<br />\nany operator on any project snapshot another user's unshared personal<br />\nprompt by name. Must be refused now, the same way<br />\n<code>routes/prompts.py</code>'s lookup routes already refuse it (<code>P2-N</code>/<code>P2-O</code>).</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791911682420,"stop":1791911682421,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791911682465,"stop":1791911682465,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDi